# roadmap 5.1, 5.2: dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/handicap.lua gives team 1 12 points and team 2 30
# points 60 frames after tip-off, on every game; score_probe.lua logs the scoreboard digits
# and the score with the quarter table at each change of GAMSTATE or quarter.
# - the scoreboard shows the head start at tip-off (its digit objects show the numbers);
# - "Only against the CPU" (cpu_only, on by default): player 1 plays on team 1 here, so team 2
#   gets nothing (12-0); with it off both get theirs (12-30);
# - quarter 1 includes the head start and the quarters add up to the final score (pinned on
#   the T-unit games, whose runs repeat: T.E. 16-34 + 0-6 + 4-4 + 3-8 = 23-52, SE 14-38 +
#   0-15 + 3-10 + 11-4 = 28-67; the Wolf-unit runs vary, the sum held there too when measured);
# - every game reaches the end-of-game screen (GAMSTATE 8);
# - with no head start nothing is written and the scoreboard starts at 0-0 (checked on the
#   T-unit games; on the Wolf-unit games the 0 digit is not an LED_0 image the probe knows).
# NBA JAM 1993 has no kp_qscrs symbol and no prt_top_scores symbol: the script and the probe
# find prt_top_scores by its first instructions (FF900490 there).
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/handicap.lua
extra score_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse nbajam nbamht nbahangt nbahangt:nbahangt13 nbamht:nbamht103
frames 40001
env PLAY=1
run team1=0 team2=0
run team1=12 team2=30 cpu_only=0
run team1=12 team2=30 cpu_only=1
team2=0: nolog head start
nbajamte: team2=0: once scoreboard 0-0
nbajamse: team2=0: once scoreboard 0-0
nbajam: team2=0: once scoreboard 0-0
cpu_only=0: once head start given: 12 - 30
cpu_only=0: once scoreboard 12-30
cpu_only=1: once head start given: 12 - 0
cpu_only=1: once scoreboard 12-0
nbajamte: cpu_only=0: once gs=4 q=1 score 16-34 quarters 16-34
nbajamte: cpu_only=0: once gs=8 q=4 score 23-52 quarters 16-34 0-6 4-4 3-8
nbajamse: cpu_only=0: once gs=4 q=1 score 14-38 quarters 14-38
nbajamse: cpu_only=0: once gs=8 q=4 score 28-67 quarters 14-38 0-15 3-10 11-4
nbajamte: cpu_only=1: once gs=8 q=4 score 17-46 quarters 12-17 0-9 2-12 3-8
nbajam: cpu_only=0: once gs=8 q=4 score 43-59
cpu_only=0: log gs=8 q=4
cpu_only=1: log gs=8 q=4
